\section{$N$-Scaling Detailed Analysis}\label{app:n_scaling}

Tables~\ref{tab:n-scaling}--\ref{tab:sigma-comparison} provide detailed $N$-scaling analysis on Qwen3-8B SciERC with 3-seed statistics.

